{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tasks on the ToDo LisT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to get rid of the monotonous life, when finishing the todo, they gradually find out the truth of their lives.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/PageGIF_Burger.gif?t=1745408630\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, a mysterious person called <strong>Mr. Owl</strong> on one channel left a hint which might change the future. Can you catch these chances?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Various Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your daily choices with todo will bring different endings. For better or for worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Special Puzzle Solving Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perhaps the daily routines are easy and bored for you, but clues were hidden on every corner of your life. Solve these puzzles, there might be a bigger conspiracy behind the <strong>ToDo LisT</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/PPCare.gif?t=1745408630\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/library_hero-Mirror180.png?t=1745408630\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357930?t=1745408630","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745408630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/9e827cdd1d6495965458725d0227bef8df3145f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745408630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/9e827cdd1d6495965458725d0227bef8df314